  "body": "I believe that there is a simple typo in 15.2 Non-conforming features.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/obsolete.html#non-conforming-features\r\n> 15.2 Non-conforming features\r\n> margintop on body elements\r\n\r\nThe \"margintop\" should be \"topmargin\".\r\n\r\nReference:\r\nhttps://dxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/html/HTMLBodyElement.cpp#58\r\nhttps://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/html/HTMLBodyElement.cpp?l=52\r\n\r\nExample of usage\r\nhttp://www.kodomo.go.jp/gallery/index_e.html\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<body onload=\"preloadImages();preloadImages('images/top_home_over.gif');\" leftmargin=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" topmargin=\"0\">\r\n```\r\n\r\nI will open the PR within days.\r\n",
